    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44581" root="&#xA;                        وسم&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِيسَمٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A brand,</i> or <i>mark made with a hot iron.</i>
(TA, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِدَادٌ</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Originally] <i>A branding,</i>
or <i>cauterizing, instrument</i> [or <i>iron</i>]; (S, K;) <i>a
marking instrument.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>An impress,</i>
or <i>a character, of beauty.</i> (S, K.) See an ex.
in a verse cited voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَثِمَ</span>.

